---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Figure 02"
  title="Corrupt the input, keep the target clean"
  caption="Source-inspired diagram from pages 1 and 13. Corruption changes the model input to x̃; reconstruction is still compared with the clean original x. No particular noise distribution is assumed."
>
  <svg class="dae-wide" viewBox="0 0 700 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="dae-wide-title dae-wide-desc">
    <title id="dae-wide-title">Denoising autoencoder with a clean reconstruction target</title>
    <desc id="dae-wide-desc">Clean input x is corrupted into x tilde, then passed through an encoder and decoder to reconstruction x hat. The target arrow bypasses corruption and carries the clean x to the reconstruction comparison.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="dae-wide-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
      <marker id="dae-wide-target" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g text-anchor="middle" font-size="14">
      <text x="57" y="46">Clean input</text><text x="312" y="46">Corrupted input</text><text x="638" y="46">Reconstruction</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.5">
      <rect x="23" y="78" width="68" height="68" rx="2" /><rect x="135" y="84" width="98" height="56" rx="2" /><rect x="278" y="78" width="68" height="68" rx="2" /><rect x="390" y="76" width="169" height="72" rx="2" /><rect x="604" y="78" width="68" height="68" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="57" y="121" font-size="24" font-style="italic">x</text><text x="184" y="117" font-size="14">corrupt</text><text x="312" y="121" font-size="24" font-style="italic">x̃</text><text x="475" y="104" font-size="14">Autoencoder</text><text x="475" y="126" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">encoder → decoder</text><text x="638" y="121" font-size="24" font-style="italic">x̂</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#dae-wide-arrow)">
      <path d="M 96 112 Q 113 106 130 112" /><path d="M 238 112 Q 255 118 273 112" /><path d="M 351 112 Q 369 106 385 112" /><path d="M 564 112 Q 582 118 599 112" />
    </g>
    <text x="184" y="167" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">add noise</text>
    <path d="M 57 153 C 57 235 638 235 638 153" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#dae-wide-target)" />
    <rect x="234" y="207" width="226" height="26" fill="var(--paper)" />
    <text x="347" y="225" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" fill="var(--accent)">clean x remains the target</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="dae-narrow" viewBox="0 0 330 500" role="img" aria-labelledby="dae-narrow-title dae-narrow-desc">
    <title id="dae-narrow-title">Denoising: corrupted input, clean target</title>
    <desc id="dae-narrow-desc">Clean x goes through corruption to x tilde, then through the autoencoder to reconstruction x hat. A separate curved target arrow links the clean original to the reconstruction comparison.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="dae-narrow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
      <marker id="dae-narrow-target" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.5">
      <rect x="55" y="19" width="140" height="60" rx="2" /><rect x="55" y="121" width="140" height="55" rx="2" /><rect x="55" y="218" width="140" height="60" rx="2" /><rect x="47" y="320" width="156" height="64" rx="2" /><rect x="55" y="426" width="140" height="60" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="125" y="43" font-size="14">Clean input</text><text x="125" y="66" font-size="21" font-style="italic">x</text>
      <text x="125" y="143" font-size="14">Corrupt</text><text x="125" y="164" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">add noise</text>
      <text x="125" y="242" font-size="14">Corrupted input</text><text x="125" y="266" font-size="21" font-style="italic">x̃</text>
      <text x="125" y="345" font-size="14">Autoencoder</text><text x="125" y="368" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">encoder → decoder</text>
      <text x="125" y="450" font-size="14">Reconstruction</text><text x="125" y="474" font-size="21" font-style="italic">x̂</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#dae-narrow-arrow)">
      <path d="M 125 84 Q 119 100 125 116" /><path d="M 125 181 Q 131 197 125 213" /><path d="M 125 283 Q 119 299 125 315" /><path d="M 125 389 Q 131 405 125 421" />
    </g>
    <path d="M 201 49 C 300 49 300 456 201 456" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#dae-narrow-target)" />
    <rect x="218" y="215" width="98" height="80" fill="var(--paper)" />
    <text x="265" y="237" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--accent)"><tspan x="265">clean x</tspan><tspan x="265" dy="20">remains</tspan><tspan x="265" dy="20">the target</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  .dae-narrow { display: none; }
  @container (max-width: 580px) {
    .dae-wide { display: none; }
    .dae-narrow { display: block; max-width: 390px; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
</style>
